## 2. Zero Ad-Hoc Probing Invariant (Critical)
- **Strictly Forbidden:** Writing ad-hoc scratch scripts (`test_*.py`, `check_ports.py`, socket checkers) to probe background ports (9223 Flow CDP, 8085 proxy) or inspect cookies.
- **Mandatory Direct Execution:** Always execute production directly via the unified CLI:
  ```bash
  # Plan-only blueprint (Zero-cost / No-render):
  python tools/cinematic_studio_cli.py produce-film "Title" --genre "Sci-Fi Survival" --duration 60 --plan-only

  # Full Physical Render (Google Flow CDP + Voice + FFmpeg):
  python tools/cinematic_studio_cli.py produce-film "Title" --genre "Sci-Fi Survival" --duration 60 --voice-provider deepgram

  # Dry-run validation:
  python tools/cinematic_studio_cli.py produce-film "Title" --genre "Sci-Fi Survival" --duration 60 --dry-run
  ```
- The engine (`engine/flow_bridge.py`, `engine/editor.py`) manages server lifecycles, health checks, and cookie rotations internally. Never waste turns probing infrastructure.

