## 3. Pure Engine & Pure Skill Invariant: Absolute Zero Hardcode
- **Python Engines (`engine/`, `tools/`):** Pure execution pipelines only. Never hardcode creative narrative text, character dialogue, scene lines, camera instructions, or word substitution dictionaries.
- **Skill Files (`.grok/skills/*.md`):** Contain universal directing principles, physical/acoustic laws, and structural criteria. Never hardcode scene scripts or literal CTA strings.
- **UI Components (`web_ui/`, `web_react/`, `web_nicegui/`):** Must be 100% parametric. Components take dynamic props and JSON payloads; no hardcoded narrative elements.

